{
  "uid": "conta-transfers",
  "title": "Conta Digital: transfers",
  "description": "Orquestrador do Pix (Fase 3, ADR-0007): RED do aceite, saga (desfechos, transições, compensações, etapas, liquidação), dependências (latência, falhas, retries, circuit breaker), idempotência, logs e traces. Provisionado como código: edite o JSON, não a interface.",
  "tags": [
    "conta-digital",
    "transfers",
    "fase-3"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "TransfersService (RED)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chamadas por segundo",
      "description": "StartPix, GetPix e GetLimits por código. StartPix só aceita: o resultado do Pix sai da saga.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rpc_method, rpc_response_status_code) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",rpc_method=~\"conta.transfers.v1.TransfersService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}} {{rpc_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas do servidor (% das chamadas)",
      "description": "Base do SLI 'iniciar um Pix' (seção 7.3): StartPix sem falha do servidor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * ((sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",rpc_method=~\"conta.transfers.v1.TransfersService/.*\",rpc_response_status_code=~\"UNKNOWN|DEADLINE_EXCEEDED|INTERNAL|UNAVAILABLE|DATA_LOSS\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",rpc_method=~\"conta.transfers.v1.TransfersService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or (0 * sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",rpc_method=~\"conta.transfers.v1.TransfersService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência p99",
      "description": "O aceite grava a transferência e responde; não espera antifraude, ledger nem SPI.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"transfers\",rpc_method=~\"conta.transfers.v1.TransfersService/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Saga",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Desfechos por minuto",
      "description": "Pix que terminaram: completed, reversed (dinheiro saiu e voltou) ou rejected (não saiu), por motivo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "60 * sum by (transfers_state, transfers_reason) (rate(transfers_pix_outcomes_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_state}} {{transfers_reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transições por segundo",
      "description": "Cada aresta da máquina de estados (ADR-0007, seção 2).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (transfers_from, transfers_to) (rate(transfers_saga_transitions_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_from}} → {{transfers_to}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Compensações por minuto",
      "description": "Devolução do limite (recusa ou estorno) e estorno do débito.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "60 * sum by (transfers_compensation) (rate(transfers_compensations_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_compensation}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duração p99 por etapa",
      "description": "A liquidação inclui as tentativas e o backoff; retry_later = sem resposta definitiva, volta depois.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, transfers_step) (rate(transfers_saga_step_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_step}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Etapas sem resposta definitiva",
      "description": "Etapas que soltaram o lease para tentar depois (ledger fora do ar, por exemplo). O Pix fica parado no mesmo estado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (transfers_step) (rate(transfers_saga_step_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",transfers_result=\"retry_later\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_step}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tentativas de liquidação por desfecho",
      "description": "ambiguous = timeout e afins (pode ter liquidado); not_sent = circuito aberto (prova de que não saiu). Seção 4.5.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (transfers_settle_result) (rate(transfers_settlement_attempts_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{transfers_settle_result}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dependências",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência p99 das chamadas",
      "description": "Do lado do transfers (cliente gRPC), por método. Os prazos: antifraude 300 ms, ledger 500 ms, SPI 1 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas das chamadas por código",
      "description": "Só falhas de infraestrutura; recusas de negócio (NOT_FOUND, FAILED_PRECONDITION) não aparecem aqui.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rpc_method, rpc_response_status_code) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"transfers\",rpc_response_status_code=~\"UNKNOWN|DEADLINE_EXCEEDED|INTERNAL|UNAVAILABLE|DATA_LOSS\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}} {{rpc_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Retries por dependência",
      "description": "Novas tentativas com backoff exponencial e full jitter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (dependency) (rate(transfers_dependency_retries_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dependency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Estado do circuit breaker",
      "description": "0 fechado, 1 meio-aberto, 2 aberto. Aberto por mais de 1 min vira alerta na Fase 6.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 27
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (dependency) (transfers_circuit_breaker_state{job=\"transfers\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{dependency}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Aceite e idempotência",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Aceites por minuto",
      "description": "replay = repetição pela mesma chave (devolve o mesmo Pix, sem criar outro).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "60 * sum by (transfers_replay) (rate(transfers_pix_started_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "replay={{transfers_replay}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Valor aceito por minuto (R$)",
      "description": "Soma dos Pix novos, em reais (centavos / 100).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "60 * sum(rate(transfers_pix_started_amount_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])) / 100",
          "legendFormat": "R$"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conflitos de idempotência e leases perdidos",
      "description": "Chave reutilizada com outro pedido; lease tomado por outro runner (fencing token barrou a escrita).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 36
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(transfers_idempotency_conflicts_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "chave reutilizada"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(transfers_leases_lost_total{job=\"transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "lease perdido"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs e traces",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs do transfers",
      "description": "Um log por chamada gRPC e um aviso por etapa sem resposta definitiva; trace_id vira link.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"transfers\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Sagas com erro",
      "description": "Traces com alguma etapa da saga em erro. Um Pix tem um trace só: aceite, etapas e chamadas a antifraude, ledger e SPI.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 45
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"transfers\" && name =~ \"pix.saga.*\" && status = error }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
